.TH "user:list" 1 "September 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
user:list \- Lists all registered framework users.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php user:list
[\-\-json] [\-\-app=\fIAPP\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Queries the framework database for registered users and displays them in a tabular layout or machine-readable JSON format.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-json
Outputs results in structured JSON format.
.TP
.BR \-\-app =\fIAPP\fR
Targets a specific application context.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
Connects to the configured relational database, queries the spp_users table, and serializes output.
